<title>USA: New York Health Care Inc Q4 summary.</title>
<headline>New York Health Care Inc Q4 summary.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended    For the Year Ended</p>
<p>		   12/31/96   12/31/95	12/31/96	2/31/95</p>
<p>Net  patient  service</p>
<p>revenue $2,920,535(a) $3,227,978 $11,920,017(a) $11,809,728</p>
<p> Net income  145,746(b)    279,338     570,638(b)   1,128,011</p>
<p>Pro forma net income per</p>
<p>common share and common</p>
<p>share equivalents</p>
<p>		     .04(b)	  .08	   .09(b)	   .20</p>
<p>Pro forma weighted average</p>
<p>number of common share</p>
<p>and common share</p>
<p>equivalents</p>
<p>		  3,409,469  3,405,437	3,409,469   3,405,437</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Net patient service revenues do not reflect a one-time special contract for home health aid services in the amount of $264,225.</p>
<p>(b) Net income was adjusted for non recurring-non operating charges of ($343,287) or 10 cents per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
